name=Zomboid Fixes B42.20
id=ZomboidFixesB42
author=Tien
description=A collection of fixes for Build 42.20, mostly for multiplayer.
description=- Fast Timed Actions makes item transfers quick in multiplayer.
description=- Changing an animal's gender now sticks for everyone.
description=- The foraging debug menu works, and added icons can be picked up.
description=- Item editor changes save for items anywhere, not just your own inventory.
description=- The admin tag shows for every admin cheat, with an option to hide it.
description=- Items with negative weight are deleted automatically (optional).
description=- Clothing destroyed while worn now stays destroyed after relogging (optional).
description=- Metal and Articulated Metal Shin Armor run speeds are no longer swapped.
description=- Chickens deleted by the game when they finish laying in a hutch are put back (optional).
description=Must be installed on both the server and clients.
modversion=1.0
